<title>USA: Sierra says Physician suit meritless.</title>
<headline>Sierra says Physician suit meritless.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Health Services Inc said Wednesday a lawsuit filed against it by Physician Corp of America was meritless.</p>
<p>Physician Corp has filed suit in Federal court in Miami seeking specific performance of the merger agreement the companies executed last November, monetary damages and other relief.</p>
<p>Sierra ended its merger agreement with Physician Corp on Tuseday. It had been reevaluating the proposed merger since February 20, when Physician Corp said it would take additional charges in its fiscal fourth quarter of 1996 to cover increased liabilities associated with its workers' compensation division.</p>
</text>
